# NFR-CMP-01 — the device population the SRS commits to, stated once so the compiler
# honours it rather than leaving it to a test matrix nobody reruns.
#
# Table 2.4 names Android 8.0 and later, iOS 14 and later, and the current plus one
# prior major version of Chrome, Firefox, Safari and Edge. The floor that actually
# matters is Android 8: its system WebView is Chromium 61, which has no optional
# chaining and no nullish coalescing. Without this file the build targets modern
# browsers and ships syntax that throws on the reference device in Table 2.3 —
# a blank screen on exactly the handset the product is designed for.
chrome >= 61
edge >= 79
firefox >= 78
safari >= 14
ios_saf >= 14
android >= 8

# And the current-plus-one obligation for desktop.
last 2 chrome versions
last 2 firefox versions
last 2 safari versions
last 2 edge versions

not dead
